// These are variants of the font and bitmap resources.
// 
// The height of these font resource variants is reduced to match the screen size \
// of 480x272 pixel. 
// The bitmap resources variants are using a different set of image files, which \
// are prepared for the screen size of 480x272 pixel.
// 
// As soon as the variant condition is fulfilled, these variants are used within \
// the application.
note legend Note5
{
  attr Bounds = <20,450,590,610>;
}

// These are variants of the washing machine main screen and start button.
// 
// They are adapted in their layout in order to fit into a screen with a size of \
